			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750350401,
					"content": "Welcome to our shop! If you'd like us to cut a gemstone, you're in the right place!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750350402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Imix"
				},
				{
					"id": 750350402,
					"content": "Hey there! We do have a gemstone here, and we'd like to have it custom-processed. It's for our little Tepetlisaurus companion, ta-da! Here it is—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750350403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750350403,
					"content": "Wow! This gem is of truly exceptional quality! Look at the size, and how clear it is... If you'd like a custom job, the processing will be quite difficult...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750350404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Imix"
				},
				{
					"id": 750350404,
					"content": "Now that sounds familiar. So what's next, extra fees?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750350405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750350405,
					"content": "No! Of course not! Just what kind of person do you think I am!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750350406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Imix"
				},
				{
					"id": 750350406,
					"content": "Our shop specializes in the art of cutting and polishing gemstones. If we run into a good one, we'd rather polish it for free, and let its beauty speak for our quality as it carries our name out into the world. We'd never set high prices willy-nilly!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750350407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Imix"
				},
				{
					"id": 750350407,
					"content": "But just as a good artisan seeks the best materials to work with, so do the best gemstones require a suitable artisan to work them. I know just such a \"Gem Master,\" and he would be perfect for doing this one justice!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750350408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Imix"
				},
				{
					"id": 750350408,
					"content": "Whoa, that's amazing! Quick, call the Gem Master out!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750350409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750350409,
					"content": "Aha, but you might need to make an appointment in advance if you'd like to see him. If you don't, chances are he'll be out seeking inspiration...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750350410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Imix"
				},
				{
					"id": 750350410,
					"content": "Seeking inspiration?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750350411
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750350411,
					"content": "Yeah! Master Kulahaw is pretty unusual even among master craftsmen. He doesn't believe that artisans should just polish a gemstone according to blueprints, but that they should understand how to observe all the beauty the natural world has to offer.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750350412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Imix"
				},
				{
					"id": 750350412,
					"content": "For example, learning polishing techniques from the tiny ripples on a lake's surface, or fretwork patterns from the shifting and billowing clouds... he calls it gathering inspiration!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750350413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Imix"
				},
				{
					"id": 750350413,
					"content": "Uh... Sounds kinda complicated...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750350414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750350414,
					"content": "Still, if you're in a hurry, you can go out and find him wherever he happens to be gathering inspiration from! Let me mark where he said he was going for you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Imix"
				}
			]
		},
